#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119522 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ecdc6a5a-5aba-5547-97aa-db3cd2e90ae6" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "3545b168-5226-5f47-ac0d-3ff5509e866e" :question/math-academy-id "e-4447" :question/problem "What is the minor of $a_{13}$ in\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "To get the minor of $a_{13}$, we remove the $1$st row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 1 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & ∗ & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 0\\end{vmatrix}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119523 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "8e61e639-f165-5157-91c0-e9a6faf734a6" :question/math-academy-id "e-4448" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of $d_{23}$ in\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 7 & -3 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 8 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of $d_{23}$, we remove the $2$nd row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & ∗ & -6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & -2 & ∗ \\\\ 6 & 0 & ∗ & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & ∗ & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of $d_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_{23} &= (-1)^{2 + 3}M_{23} \\\\\n&=-M_{23} \\\\\n&= -\\begin{vmatrix}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{vmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119524 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/id #uuid "3e091496-053c-59fb-90d6-d8fb89ea6004" :question/math-academy-id "e-4449" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(A) &= a_{11}C_{11} + a_{12}C_{12} + a_{13}C_{13} + a_{14}C_{14} \\\\\n&= 0 \\cdot C_{11} + 0 \\cdot C_{12} + 2 \\cdot C_{13} + 0 \\cdot C_{14} \\\\\n&= 2C_{13} \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot\\begin{vmatrix}∗ & ∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 1 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & ∗ & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 2(-1)^{1 + 3}\\begin{vmatrix}5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 2(5\\begin{vmatrix}6 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{vmatrix}- 1\\begin{vmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 0\\end{vmatrix}+ 0\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 6 \\\\ -6 & 3\\end{vmatrix}) \\\\\n&= 2(5(6 \\cdot 0 + 1 \\cdot 3) - (1 \\cdot 0 - (-1) \\cdot (-6)) + 0(1 \\cdot 3 - 6 \\cdot (-6))) \\\\\n&= 2(15 + 6 + 0) \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot 21 \\\\\n&= 42\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120327 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be4e260d-12d5-5ca9-bff9-1a1f57d6bcc4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 5 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 0\\end{vmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186118438} {:answer/id #uuid "fa409ac3-0f22-5010-a729-e9af06b2f1f1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 5 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 0\\end{vmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186118439} {:answer/id #uuid "4a071790-d6f6-5f3a-b7d4-e249b2170313" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{vmatrix}1 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1\\end{vmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186118440} {:answer/id #uuid "627